      <uighur>dekdekekü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>дэгдээх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>DEGDEGE-</transcript>
      <definition>[v. caus. of degde] To raise; to startle up; to stir up, provoke; to start.</definition>
      <page>241</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠠᠶᠢᠨ ᠪᠠᠶᠢᠯᠳᠤᠭᠠᠨ ᠢ ᠳᠠᠺᠳᠠᠺᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
          <transcript>dain bailduγan i --ky</transcript>
          <definition> To start a war.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠣᠭᠤᠰᠤ ᠳᠠᠺᠳᠠᠺᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
          <transcript>toγusu --ky</transcript>
          <definition> To stir up dust.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
